b9: binding-only acquire, durable reservation before the provider call, one in-memory flight, fresh checks each read, 503 at the caps.\n\nSecurity: no new authority. The token has read scope and is minted only after the provider-reported remote and the current configuration match; the plaintext now rests in the object's private SQL for at most the token's life, which the ruling accepts as private durable custody, and expired rows are deleted by acquisition and alarm; no plaintext or provider payload appears in errors or logs; generation compare-and-set prevents a stale install; the caps bound storage and concurrency; close never revokes a shared token. The acquireSiteRead method is reachable only through the SCOPE_INDEX binding of the same Worker, the trust domain that held per-request plaintext before. Seals reproduce and the inventory bijection passes. The hold is local ownership, not provider exactly-once, as the note states.\n\nSimplification: the duplicate clearing block in site-route.test.ts; nothing else.\n\nFindings:\n1. Blocking: no passing ordinary gate at the head's production and test bytes (above). One gate at this exact head, recorded and indexed, then refile.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:432337aef5f6914d277287cb75cbe1b06803b2c2","binding":"assigned","head":"96bb50e6dc2a5af68224542841eaee232e0fac43","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:fbe59a99d38a875f20668520cd8f93159edc1c9a\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:a30fe0fbbd57622c6955070c0587d11519b556a4\",\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1ba5d9b1cfc57107dd08fa003db7bb40a3f69da4\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:2e1ab66cff42d28de3fd9af422eab6d5c6ef4e0d\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1ba5d9b1cfc57107dd08fa003db7bb40a3f69da4","review_path":"reviewguard@